=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>木曜日 2023年10月05日 19時47分58秒</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue47\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 47</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>the return value was misspecified as the return value of <code>imbue()</code>\n</td>\n<td>corrected\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/ios_base/imbue\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>imbue</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets locale <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/ios_base","title":"std::ios_base"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ios_base::getloc","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Returns the current locale associated with the stream."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The locale object associated with the stream."},{"label":"Example","note":"The output shown was obtained using the clang compiler."},{"label":"See also","children":[{"l